SUMMARY:Walking in the city\, a Cultural Perspective Roundtable - by
  CivicTechBrampton
LOCATION:Algoma University\, 8 Queen St E Brampton\, ON L6V 1A2\, Canada
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://luma.com/z1qsle7e\n\nHosted by
  CivicTechBrampton (https://civictechbrampton.ca/)\n\n​Join for a
  discussion exploring what it means to walk in our city. Bringing together
  perspectives on race\, nature\, and urban planning\, the conversation
  will examine how the design and experience of city streets\, sidewalks\,
  parks\, and green spaces shape people’s everyday mobility\, sense of
  belonging\, and connection to nature.
END:VEVENT
