SUMMARY:Toronto Launch: Revolutions of Our Times  - by The Peoples Want
LOCATION:Another Story Bookshop
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/toronto-launch-revolutions-of-our-times-by-th
 e-peoples-want-tickets-2002752890809\n\nHosted by The Peoples Want
  (https://thepeopleswant.org/)\n\nThe Peoples Want present the Toronto
  launch of Revolution of Our Times with Leila al-Shami & Elia Ayoub. From
  the encounters between rebels from the global peripheries\, fighters from
  the margins of North America\, and dissidents from the centres of
  Empire\, this book weaves a fabric of transnational solidarity.
END:VEVENT
