SUMMARY:Listen Up! A Downtown Toronto Sound Walk - by No More Noise Toronto
LOCATION:King Street and University\, M5H 4H2
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.tickettailor.com/events/nomorenoisetoronto/2449979\n\nHosted
  by No More Noise Toronto (https://nomorenoisetoronto.com/)\n\nAn
  engaging\, immersive stroll through downtown designed to change how you
  hear your surroundings. A guided walk to analyze urban noise sources\,
  discuss their impact on our health and well-being\, and explore practical
  policy changes needed to build quieter\, more liveable communities.
END:VEVENT
