SUMMARY:Songs of Resistance - by Firdaus-é-Inquilab
LOCATION:90 Eglington Ave E
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/DesEJRntrUs/\n\nHosted
  by Firdaus-é-Inquilab
  (https://www.instagram.com/firdaus.inquilab/)\n\nResistance music carries
  stories\, struggles\, histories across borders and across generations.
  From songs of freedom to anthems of protest\, music has long been a way
  to remember\, resist\, and reclaim our voices. Join this workshop to
  explore the stories behind these songs\, share music that moves us\, and
  sing together in a collective 'Singing Laboratory'!
END:VEVENT
