SUMMARY:Inspiring Talks: How to Change the Law: Dr. Henry Morgentaler\, a
  Case Study - by Academy for Lifelong Learning
LOCATION:Tartu College\, 310 Bloor St. West
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://allto.ca/event/equality-backslide/\n\nHosted
  by Academy for Lifelong Learning (https://allto.ca/)\n\nDr. Henry
  Morgentaler was charged\, jailed\, and publicly targeted for providing
  medical abortions to Canadian women\, yet his determination ultimately
  reshaped Canadian law.  His long legal battle led to the legalization of
  abortion in Canada\, transforming both public policy and access to
  reproductive health care. 
END:VEVENT
